305
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:20,537
And in the face of the treasure,
there was one thing I remember most.

306
00:20:20,620 --> 00:20:24,100
All I could hear was Roger

307
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:31,157
He just laughed So did we all On

308
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:35,000
and on until tears fell from our eyes

309
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:49,840
Oh, Joy Boy Amazing

310
